<title>INDIA: Indian Nov fertiliser output rises.</title>
<headline>Indian Nov fertiliser output rises.</headline>
<dateline>NEW DELHI 1997-01-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>India's fertiliser production rose in November 1996 compared with the same month in 1995, the government said on Saturday.</p>
<p>    PRODUCTION    Nov 96     Nov 95	     Apr-Nov</p>
<p>							 1996     1995</p>
<p>    Nitrogenous     759	713.2	 5,454.4  5,653.1</p>
<p>    Phosphatic	242	206.3	 1,630.6  1,683.1</p>
<p>NOTE - Figures are in thousands of tonnes and those for 1996 are preliminary.</p>
</text>
